WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Piston pin
What it does: Forms the joint that lets the rod tilt while the piston travels in a straight line.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Piston pin
How it works: The connecting rod changes angle around the joint.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Piston pin
How it moves: Travels with the piston while permitting relative rotation at the joint.
